{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sculptor you create statues of girls: broke stone segments, use special skills and paint color. Improve your skills with the teacher and become more effective in creating sculptures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Follow the story of a lonely sculptor who created a statue of a girl and fell in love with her. To bring her to life, he makes a deal with the goddess Aphrodite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Unusual mechanics of three-stage sculpture creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. A strong story inspired by ancient Greek myth of Pygmalion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. The setting of Ancient Greece and myths.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340510?t=1770049023","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340510?t=1770049023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340510/1b99055939d860d27ff52d2a096b4d1a48e331e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770049023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340510/1b99055939d860d27ff52d2a096b4d1a48e331e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770049023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game have two picture of animal sacrifice."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sculptor you create statues of girls: broke stone segments, use special skills and paint color. Improve your skills with the teacher and become more effective in creating sculptures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Follow the story of a lonely sculptor who created a statue of a girl and fell in love with her. To bring her to life, he makes a deal with the goddess Aphrodite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F